ADDITIONAL VISIBLE UI ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENT:
Any public deployment, modification, or redistribution of this software 
must display a visible and prominent attribution in the main user interface 
of the website (for example, in the footer or in the "About/Credits" section). 

To satisfy this requirement, the user must choose ONE of the following options:

Option 1: Include a visible, clickable hyperlink pointing back to the original 
project repository (https://github.com/SusPect147/Compass) with the text: 
"Based on Compass by SusPect147" or "Powered by Compass".

Option 2: Alternatively, if a hyperlink is not used, include a prominent and 
clearly visible text mention of the author "hammer147", explicitly stating 
that the website is built on or based on the original code developed by "hammer147" 
(for example: "Based on original code by hammer147" or "Created on the basis of code by hammer147").
